[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_mh00m")
pages = Array[String](["[font=res://assets/fonts/Caveat-Regular.ttf]I got my report card back and I only had one B. The rest were all A's. I thought mom and dad would be super excited but dad just said, \"Nice job, kiddo.\" And then they started arguing about who put the car keys where.

I don't know what to do anymore. I feel alone in this house. I dread coming home from school and I hate school. I'm so frustrated. And Lindsey barely even talks to me at school anymore. We used to spend literally every single day together. I don't even know what I did to piss her off.
[/font]", "[font=res://assets/fonts/Caveat-Regular.ttf]I hung out with Brian and Mandy outside of school today. They were ditching class so I went with them. Doesn't really matter either way. They're wild. Mandy stole a lipgloss from Savers Family Mart and Brian smoked. It's the first time I've seen anyone from school smoke before.

He's kind of cool and Mandy's actually really pretty. I really want a skateboard so that I can go with them to the skate park. They said they hang out with the older kids there.[/font]", "[font=res://assets/fonts/Caveat-Regular.ttf]I asked dad for a skateboard and he like totally freaked out about bills. It's so stupid. I literally can't ask for anything. So, I went with Mandy to Edge Sports Co. and she distracted the guy working at the shop while I grabbed a skateboard and ran. It was crazy, my heart's never raced so fast.

To be honest though, I cried later thinking about it because I felt so bad. I'd never tell Mandy that in a million years though.

But then, the next day, I went to the skatepark with Brian and Mandy and we hung out with [/font]", "[font=res://assets/fonts/Caveat-Regular.ttf]the older kids. One of them was like... doing drugs. Mandy said it was nothing crazy, just pot. I've never seen anyone do that before though. It smelled so bad.[/font]", "[font=res://assets/fonts/Caveat-Regular.ttf]I met this guy Dylan at the skate park and he invited me to a party with high schoolers. Mandy said we should go tonight. I'm nervous to ask mom. But like she hasn't even noticed me in like a month so I don't know why she would care.[/font]", "[font=res://assets/fonts/Caveat-Regular.ttf]Mom completely freaked when I asked to go to the party. Then dad started fighting with her and she was yelling at me too. Apparently I'm hanging out with the \"wrong crowd\". It's so stupid. She doesn't even know them. She doesn't even know me.[/font]", "[font=res://assets/fonts/ReenieBeanie-Regular.ttf]I snuck out to the party. It was a lot. I feel like I grew up 5 years at it. I made out with Dylan which was my first kiss. It was kind of gross actually. He tasted like cigarettes and his hair was really greasy. But then he lit a cigarette with weed. He said it wasn't a big deal because I think I looked nervous. I smoked some too. I guess it was fine, but I couldn't stop coughing for like 20 minutes. It was pretty fun actually.

It definitely wasn't anything like mom said it was. She made it sound like I was gonna see monsters and then pass out and die. I can never talk to her about this kind of stuff.[/font]", "[font=res://assets/fonts/ReenieBeanie-Regular.ttf]It's been a while since I've written in this... Things keep getting out of control. I haven't been to school in a week. I just go hang out with Dylan and we smoke. I've tried other stuff too now. I feel out of control and lost. I miss when I was a kid. I miss when mom used to read me books and sing me lullabys. I miss when mom and dad loved each other. I miss feeling loved back.[/font]", "[font=res://assets/fonts/ReenieBeanie-Regular.ttf]Mom found my weed, well, technically it was Dylan's. I tried to explain that because she started to freak and then she just started to freak out more like \"who's Dylan\" and stuff. It was stupid. And then she called me a spoiled brat.

I told her that I hated her. She said she hated me too. Dad just kept watching TV in the living room.

In what way am I spoiled? I have nothing and no one. Dylan just uses me, I don't think Mandy and Brian even like me, and Lindsey has forgotten I exist. I'm pretty sure I'm gonna fail all of my classes this trimester and mom and dad are gonna disown me.[/font]", "[font=res://assets/fonts/ReenieBeanie-Regular.ttf]It's too much. I don't know what to do.[/font]", "[font=res://assets/fonts/ReenieBeanie-Regular.ttf]I had a really bad day.

Dylan was making out with Mandy at this party so I left. I drank too much probably and threw up a bunch. I just went home and cried for a long time. Then I went out of my room for dinner and mom and dad were screaming at each other. I think they're gonna get a divorce. I don't think either of them want me in the divorce.[/font]", "[font=res://assets/fonts/ReenieBeanie-Regular.ttf]I can't do this anymore. More shit goes wrong every day. I don't even know where I'm going or why I'm doing anything that I'm doing. I'm invisible and feel like nobody wants me around.[/font]", "[font=res://assets/fonts/ReenieBeanie-Regular.ttf]I give up. I'm done. Sorry. Bye.[/font]"])
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://da3bhldqy5jpx"
